<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FAFCFE', padding: 0, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 36, width: '1152px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0E9B78', borderRadius: 5, padding: '3px 11px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>第 92 节</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>核心知识点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· ★ 虚拟环境与 Django 项目</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.1 虚拟环境：给每个项目一间独立的「工具间」★</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ll_env 是两个小写的 L 加 env，不是数字 1。教材特意提醒过这一点。</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· pip install 前一定看一眼有没有 (ll_env)。没有它，Django 会被装到全局 Py…</text><text x='82' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 关闭终端 = 虚拟环境自动失效，下次开工要重新激活。这是新手最常犯的错，没有之一</text><text x='82' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>：昨天明明跑得好好的…</text><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='686' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.2 Django 的三个层次：项目、应用程序、MVT ★</text><text x='686' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 项目（project）= 餐厅的营业执照和规章制度。全项目一份，规定「本店用什么灶、账</text><text x='686' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>记在哪」。</text><text x='686' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 应用程序（app）= 厨房、收银台、库房。可以有很多个，各干各的活；它们协同工作，</text><text x='686' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>让项目成为一个整体…</text><text x='686' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· settings.py 里的 INSTALLED_APPS：每新建一个 app，都要来这里「注册学籍」…</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
            <text x='64' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Python 讲授课件 · 逐节版</text>
            <text x='1216' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' textAnchor='end' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>单元 18 · 第 92 节</text>
        </svg>
    </Box>
